WEBVTT

01:41.490 --> 01:45.960
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.630 --> 01:48.960
[Episode 19]

01:50.840 --> 01:51.400
Mr. Yu?

02:04.480 --> 02:05.150
Mr. Yu?

02:07.040 --> 02:07.710
Mr. Yu?

02:09.120 --> 02:09.590
Ranran.

02:09.970 --> 02:11.250
Luckily, it was severed in time.

02:11.440 --> 02:12.770
Only half of your soul was taken.

02:12.800 --> 02:13.520
It will come back.

02:15.840 --> 02:16.360
Thank you.

02:25.280 --> 02:25.840
Master.

02:37.930 --> 02:38.560
Master!

02:38.800 --> 02:39.840
There seems to be an exit over there.

02:40.000 --> 02:40.400
Let's go.

02:42.200 --> 02:42.880
Quickly, let's go.

02:52.680 --> 02:53.470
Are you hurt?

02:54.560 --> 02:55.400
I'm fine.

02:56.160 --> 02:57.000
Xue Ranran.

02:57.240 --> 02:58.190
I was wrong.

02:58.630 --> 02:59.660
I didn't listen to you.

03:00.400 --> 03:01.680
But that monstrous head

03:01.780 --> 03:02.750
almost devoured

03:02.750 --> 03:03.750
Mr. Yu's soul.

03:04.280 --> 03:05.360
I couldn't just stand by and watch.

03:06.150 --> 03:07.430
Master, please punish me if you want.

03:08.310 --> 03:09.470
Ranran fell into danger

03:09.470 --> 03:10.360
for saving me.

03:11.370 --> 03:12.250
However you plan to punish her,

03:12.280 --> 03:13.590
please punish me instead.

03:16.110 --> 03:17.040
Who do you think you are?

03:17.620 --> 03:18.440
Since when do you have a say

03:18.470 --> 03:19.910
in the Wester Sect's affairs?

03:20.840 --> 03:21.840
If it weren't for your incompetence,

03:21.910 --> 03:22.910
how could you have been bewitched by a devil?

03:23.240 --> 03:24.190
Didn't you

03:24.190 --> 03:24.840
hear her voice?

03:29.630 --> 03:30.150
Shui.

03:32.640 --> 03:34.050
Didn't we agree to never meet again

03:34.079 --> 03:34.840
in this life and all lives to come?

03:35.690 --> 03:36.310
Why are you

03:36.310 --> 03:37.590
showing up in front of me again?

03:42.079 --> 03:42.750
You're not her.

03:48.750 --> 03:50.430
You made her suffer so much back then,

03:50.910 --> 03:52.710
and you feel no guilt at all.

03:53.630 --> 03:54.430
How could you

03:55.430 --> 03:56.000
be so indifferent

03:56.030 --> 03:57.120
when you saw her?

03:58.590 --> 03:59.910
You believe that because you're stupid.

04:00.520 --> 04:00.910
You...

04:07.400 --> 04:08.680
We still haven't escaped from this formation?

04:09.840 --> 04:10.710
The formation

04:13.590 --> 04:15.040
has probably already expanded to the village.

04:17.120 --> 04:17.829
You three,

04:18.160 --> 04:19.360
form the Five Elements Sword Formation with me.

04:19.920 --> 04:21.070
Yes, Master.

04:38.240 --> 04:39.480
What exactly is this monster?

04:39.720 --> 04:40.580
Why is it so powerful?

04:41.070 --> 04:41.560
This thing

04:41.580 --> 04:42.330
is likely

04:42.360 --> 04:43.360
Nine-Headed Kui'ao, a vicious beast

04:43.630 --> 04:44.430
that devours souls.

04:44.950 --> 04:45.780
It has nine heads and a turtle's body.

04:45.800 --> 04:46.850
Not only can it bewitch people,

04:47.070 --> 04:48.070
but it can also create illusions

04:48.480 --> 04:49.560
and trap people in its formation.

04:50.040 --> 04:51.000
The shell on its back

04:51.480 --> 04:52.560
is the center of the formation.

04:52.870 --> 04:54.240
So this thing is a giant turtle?

04:54.510 --> 04:55.390
We've been fighting it for so long

04:55.600 --> 04:56.190
and have only seen

04:56.190 --> 04:57.100
a few of its heads.

04:57.370 --> 04:57.840
We haven't even seen

04:57.870 --> 04:59.000
its body or shell.

04:59.630 --> 05:00.430
What should we do?

05:00.920 --> 05:02.160
For now, we can only use the Five Elements Sword Formation

05:02.190 --> 05:03.120
to suppress its power

05:03.480 --> 05:04.390
and keep it from breaking through the ground.

05:18.040 --> 05:18.600
Xi'er!

05:19.510 --> 05:20.120
Xi'er!

05:21.430 --> 05:22.040
Are you alright?

05:28.680 --> 05:29.360
So it's you.

05:30.160 --> 05:31.680
Don't even think about stopping this formation!

05:31.870 --> 05:33.360
Let the Nine-Headed Kui'ao

05:33.680 --> 05:34.920
devour everything!

05:55.190 --> 05:55.750
Oh no.

06:09.800 --> 06:11.000
It won't be long

06:11.560 --> 06:12.870
before it succeeds!

06:36.480 --> 06:37.430
The Green Dragon Divine Power?

06:50.600 --> 06:51.800
We can't keep going like this.

06:57.920 --> 06:58.720
Hurry up and head east!

06:59.270 --> 06:59.750
Yes!

07:22.520 --> 07:24.070
Why is there a barrier here?

07:24.510 --> 07:25.750
Why can't that thing enter,

07:26.120 --> 07:26.950
but we can?

07:30.480 --> 07:31.470
-Master!
-Master.

07:36.340 --> 07:37.120
It seems someone

07:37.120 --> 07:37.950
has set up

07:37.950 --> 07:38.950
a powerful spiritual barrier here,

07:39.310 --> 07:40.310
preventing both mortals and evil beings from entering.

07:40.630 --> 07:41.800
That's why the Nine-Headed Kui'ao's formation

07:41.830 --> 07:42.630
is ineffective here.

07:43.000 --> 07:43.680
I never expected

07:44.120 --> 07:45.360
that the one controlling all of this

07:45.360 --> 07:46.360
behind the scenes would be Mr. Liu.

07:46.830 --> 07:47.480
How does he have

07:47.480 --> 07:48.360
such strong power?

07:48.830 --> 07:50.270
I secretly investigated before,

07:50.630 --> 07:52.040
and there was no demonic aura on him.

07:59.360 --> 08:00.870
He must have been bewitched by some evil being

08:01.030 --> 08:02.040
and gained some kind of power.

08:02.630 --> 08:04.040
If he really was bewitched by an evil being,

08:04.600 --> 08:05.800
then everything he's done

08:06.000 --> 08:07.360
is to create resentment

08:07.560 --> 08:08.480
and nourish that evil being.

08:10.860 --> 08:11.980
This formation is expanding.

08:12.720 --> 08:13.680
I don't know how long

08:13.680 --> 08:14.480
this barrier can hold.

08:15.870 --> 08:16.430
I wonder

08:16.630 --> 08:17.870
if there's some hidden secret here.

08:18.190 --> 08:19.000
Let's split up

08:19.160 --> 08:20.320
and look for a way to escape.

08:34.600 --> 08:35.840
Heaven is truly on my side!

08:36.360 --> 08:37.720
I never expected

08:37.740 --> 08:39.190
such a powerful evil being to be here now.

08:39.750 --> 08:41.549
This is the perfect opportunity

08:41.750 --> 08:43.150
to get rid of these nuisances.

08:50.510 --> 08:51.750
This spell is...

08:52.360 --> 08:53.930
Back then, they used this formation

08:53.960 --> 08:54.670
against me.

08:55.630 --> 08:57.670
Now, I'll return the favor

08:58.480 --> 08:59.550
in kind.

09:00.630 --> 09:01.910
Won't that be interesting?

09:34.400 --> 09:34.880
It looks like

09:34.910 --> 09:36.120
no one has lived here for a long time.

09:37.270 --> 09:38.720
Being able to set up such a powerful barrier,

09:39.000 --> 09:39.720
the owner

09:39.720 --> 09:40.720
must not be an ordinary person.

09:41.680 --> 09:42.410
But we can't

09:42.440 --> 09:43.550
just keep hiding here forever.

09:43.960 --> 09:45.120
Otherwise, we'll be trapped to death sooner or later.

09:46.470 --> 09:46.900
Oh, right.

09:47.440 --> 09:49.220
That Nine-Headed Kui'ao can call people's names,

09:49.360 --> 09:50.870
and only when you respond does it bewitch you.

09:51.200 --> 09:52.720
So let's each choose a codename

09:53.000 --> 09:54.030
and only call each other by that.

09:54.440 --> 09:56.390
If you hear someone calling your real name,

09:56.750 --> 09:57.520
don't answer

09:57.550 --> 09:58.080
and don't look.

09:58.360 --> 09:59.510
That way, we won't fall into its trap.

10:00.270 --> 10:01.030
Mr. Yu,

10:01.750 --> 10:02.870
how about calling you "Taro?"

10:03.030 --> 10:03.510
Master,

10:03.840 --> 10:04.550
you'll be "Pumpkin."

10:05.120 --> 10:05.750
What a coincidence.

10:06.350 --> 10:07.120
Qingge's

10:07.150 --> 10:08.200
favorite dish

10:08.220 --> 10:09.120
used to be taro,

10:09.750 --> 10:10.630
and the one she liked the least

10:11.080 --> 10:11.910
was pumpkin.

10:12.600 --> 10:13.150
Change it.

10:14.510 --> 10:15.000
Also,

10:15.840 --> 10:16.940
he's not allowed to be called "Taro."

10:19.910 --> 10:21.550
It's just a temporary codename.

10:23.510 --> 10:24.240
Alright.

10:24.750 --> 10:26.120
Well, Master, you can be...

10:26.150 --> 10:26.720
"Ice Lotus."

10:27.600 --> 10:28.240
Mr. Yu,

10:28.630 --> 10:29.320
you can be "Lingxi."

10:30.790 --> 10:31.360
Change it again.

10:33.910 --> 10:35.050
Then you can be Su the First,

10:35.080 --> 10:35.790
and you can be Su the Second.

10:36.290 --> 10:37.250
Why is he the first

10:37.440 --> 10:38.120
and I the second?

10:39.390 --> 10:39.870
No.

10:41.520 --> 10:42.880
A Crown Prince

10:43.240 --> 10:44.670
and an immortal master.

10:45.240 --> 10:46.910
Two prominent figures

10:47.550 --> 10:49.350
are arguing over something so trivial.

10:54.910 --> 10:55.440
Mr. Yu,

10:55.870 --> 10:57.270
let me help you with your wound.

11:01.390 --> 11:01.960
Yu,

11:02.640 --> 11:03.510
bear the pain.

11:09.720 --> 11:10.240
Ranran,

11:12.000 --> 11:13.390
you resemble an old friend of mine.

11:21.510 --> 11:22.270
Crown Prince,

11:22.870 --> 11:24.510
the Crown Princess is waiting for you in the palace.

11:26.810 --> 11:27.940
Why don't you check on Xi'er and the others?

11:28.910 --> 11:30.670
The matter between Master Mu and Mr. Yu

11:30.720 --> 11:31.510
has already been settled.

11:32.390 --> 11:33.240
Master still can't

11:33.270 --> 11:34.790
let go of Master Mu

11:35.280 --> 11:37.280
and keeps clashing with Mr. Yu.

11:44.030 --> 11:45.510
Do your job as the Crown Prince well

11:45.910 --> 11:47.150
and stay away from my disciples.

11:47.480 --> 11:49.030
Is it staying away from your disciples

11:49.630 --> 11:51.390
or just from Ranran?

11:52.150 --> 11:52.870
You clearly

11:52.870 --> 11:53.960
don't care about anything,

11:54.360 --> 11:56.390
but you're so concerned about Ranran.

11:56.910 --> 11:58.150
Could it be that Ranran's identity

11:59.200 --> 11:59.960
is very special?

12:00.870 --> 12:02.320
Why should I explain to you

12:02.910 --> 12:04.120
how I treat the people

12:04.150 --> 12:05.240
around me?

12:06.520 --> 12:07.480
You,

12:07.500 --> 12:08.660
a treacherous person,

12:10.150 --> 12:11.870
only hurts those who treat you well.

12:12.480 --> 12:13.430
How could Ranran,

12:13.460 --> 12:14.460
such a pure and kind girl,

12:14.650 --> 12:16.220
stay by your side?

12:17.080 --> 12:17.840
She can only have

12:18.380 --> 12:19.050
the life she wants

12:19.080 --> 12:20.360
if she comes with me.

12:25.720 --> 12:27.440
Don't you dare come near her again.

12:42.050 --> 12:42.810
Could it really be that

12:42.840 --> 12:44.430
the drop of Spirit Spring in my heart hasn't been fully removed,

12:45.270 --> 12:46.510
so now, the closer I get to the Spirit Spring,

12:47.080 --> 12:48.080
the stronger the reaction?

12:51.080 --> 12:51.480
Master,

12:51.510 --> 12:52.510
Ranran found a hidden compartment.

12:59.340 --> 13:00.070
There's a hidden compartment?

13:02.000 --> 13:02.910
Ranran, how did you know about it?

13:03.550 --> 13:04.910
I don't know why,

13:04.940 --> 13:06.610
but I just couldn't resist tapping it.

13:07.890 --> 13:09.200
Immortal, please forgive us.

13:13.550 --> 13:14.120
This is...

13:24.390 --> 13:25.000
It's her.

13:29.030 --> 13:30.320
Qingge doesn't like using sound transmission talismans,

13:31.090 --> 13:32.330
so she made wooden figurines specifically

13:32.360 --> 13:33.000
to send messages for her.

13:33.840 --> 13:34.840
This wooden figurine looks

13:34.840 --> 13:36.120
almost identical to the ones she made.

13:40.670 --> 13:41.240
Could it be...

13:42.640 --> 13:43.450
that this is really the place

13:43.480 --> 13:44.890
where Qingge once lived?

13:51.640 --> 13:52.760
There's a booklet here.

13:56.550 --> 13:58.240
It does look like

13:58.240 --> 13:59.600
Master Mu's handwriting.

14:00.670 --> 14:01.750
Sister Wu?

14:04.600 --> 14:05.670
It really is hers.

14:09.280 --> 14:11.940
[Tranquility Pavilion]

14:12.100 --> 14:13.690
This seems to be

14:13.720 --> 14:14.960
some of Master Mu's notes.

14:15.490 --> 14:16.010
Could there be

14:16.030 --> 14:17.670
information about the Nine-Headed Kui'ao?

14:18.720 --> 14:20.270
In March of the Year of Yuangui,

14:20.440 --> 14:22.320
I received help from Uncle Ye Xin.

14:26.670 --> 14:28.320
So it seems that Master Mu learned

14:28.510 --> 14:29.080
all of her abilities

14:29.080 --> 14:30.030
from this person named Ye Xin.

14:31.420 --> 14:32.240
He must be someone

14:32.240 --> 14:33.000
who's incredibly capable.

14:35.670 --> 14:37.440
This must be Uncle Ye Xin's portrait.

14:39.480 --> 14:40.080
Master.

14:43.910 --> 14:44.960
It's strange though—

14:45.630 --> 14:46.170
where...

14:46.270 --> 14:47.840
did Uncle Ye Xin go later?

14:48.360 --> 14:50.360
How come he never appeared

14:50.670 --> 14:51.750
during major events

14:51.750 --> 14:52.600
like Master Mu's death

14:53.360 --> 14:54.630
and resurrection?

14:55.900 --> 14:56.870
Since he's a master,

14:56.910 --> 14:58.670
could it be that he completed his cultivation and ascended

14:58.750 --> 14:59.720
when he was traveling the world?

15:02.550 --> 15:03.240
This person...

15:04.200 --> 15:05.030
looks familiar.

15:06.360 --> 15:07.030
Portraits

15:07.240 --> 15:08.630
always make everyone look the same, I guess.

15:21.720 --> 15:23.080
In May of the Year of Tianyi,

15:23.600 --> 15:24.440
unexpectedly,

15:24.680 --> 15:26.090
I met the young master from years ago

15:26.120 --> 15:28.120
who once gave me a meal.

15:28.870 --> 15:31.250
He was suppressing bandits with the army.

15:36.800 --> 15:38.370
Days ago, you and I worked together to eliminate the bandits.

15:38.750 --> 15:39.600
We can be considered friends

15:39.600 --> 15:40.670
who have faced hardships together.

15:41.080 --> 15:42.320
From now on, just call me by my name.

15:43.150 --> 15:43.750
Alright.

15:44.150 --> 15:45.140
I'm a few years older than you.

15:45.360 --> 15:46.550
From now on, I'll call you Yu.

15:50.860 --> 15:51.810
Turns out, Master Mu

15:51.840 --> 15:53.200
and the Crown Prince had known each other

15:53.220 --> 15:54.300
even before meeting Master.

16:01.870 --> 16:02.600
Back then, I just

16:02.630 --> 16:03.910
gave Qingge some pastry.

16:04.910 --> 16:06.720
Qingge said she would repay this kindness,

16:07.440 --> 16:08.870
but I thought she was only saying it casually.

16:09.550 --> 16:10.320
I never expected her

16:11.480 --> 16:12.840
to work so hard in cultivation

16:13.440 --> 16:14.550
just to fulfill her promise.

16:17.720 --> 16:19.320
Back then, Qingge obviously came to me

16:19.320 --> 16:20.200
out of gratitude,

16:21.080 --> 16:22.480
but I pushed her away with my own hands.

16:25.030 --> 16:26.030
Perhaps this time,

16:27.120 --> 16:28.200
I'll still have a chance.

16:29.910 --> 16:31.910
She cultivated because it was her ambition.

16:32.630 --> 16:34.000
Repaying your kindness was just something she did along the way.

16:35.400 --> 16:36.210
You don't have to

16:36.240 --> 16:37.510
relate everything to yourself.

16:44.960 --> 16:46.150
There are a few letters here.

16:52.750 --> 16:53.990
This one seems to be

16:54.510 --> 16:56.390
from the Crown Prince to Master Mu.

17:05.200 --> 17:06.550
When I was reunited with Qingge,

17:07.310 --> 17:08.790
I found we got along like old friends.

17:09.680 --> 17:10.829
We often exchanged letters.

17:12.349 --> 17:13.310
Affairs in the royal family

17:14.240 --> 17:16.109
rarely make one happy,

17:17.650 --> 17:18.410
so I unconsciously wrote to her

17:18.440 --> 17:19.640
to confide in her.

17:20.880 --> 17:22.109
And every time Qingge replied,

17:23.200 --> 17:24.310
she cheered me up.

17:26.270 --> 17:26.960
At that time,

17:28.730 --> 17:29.280
Qingge was like

17:29.310 --> 17:30.440
a light in my heart.

17:31.590 --> 17:32.680
Sounds like

17:33.200 --> 17:35.030
the past Master Mu was quite nice.

17:35.510 --> 17:36.750
But why does she

17:37.110 --> 17:38.880
seem different now?

17:40.200 --> 17:41.920
Looks like the Grandmaster was truly devoted

17:41.960 --> 17:43.440
to the Crown Prince.

17:43.680 --> 17:44.240
She even carefully treasured

17:44.260 --> 17:45.470
the letter he had written to her.

17:48.550 --> 17:49.510
I sense a hint of jealousy.

17:51.450 --> 17:52.390
It must be Master being jealous

17:52.440 --> 17:54.030
of the Grandmaster and the Crown Prince again.

18:01.880 --> 18:02.510
Wait a minute.

18:03.560 --> 18:04.850
There's also the damp,

18:04.880 --> 18:06.110
rainy scent of the monsoon season,

18:09.270 --> 18:09.850
and the sharp,

18:09.950 --> 18:11.200
spicy smell of hot peppers.

18:14.200 --> 18:14.680
Wait.

18:15.030 --> 18:15.640
Are you...

18:16.030 --> 18:16.400
eating...

18:16.720 --> 18:17.310
No, I'm not.

18:18.240 --> 18:18.830
Don't talk nonsense.

18:19.160 --> 18:20.160
Put the letters back.

18:21.400 --> 18:22.790
It's just some casual pleasantries

18:23.260 --> 18:24.610
with an acquaintance

18:24.640 --> 18:25.530
she doesn't often see,

18:26.200 --> 18:27.550
nothing to make a fuss about.

18:27.920 --> 18:28.640
Pleasantries?

18:29.350 --> 18:31.110
No matter where she was,

18:31.720 --> 18:33.790
Qingge always shared the interesting things she came across with me

18:34.200 --> 18:35.920
and cared about whether I was facing any trouble.

18:37.110 --> 18:38.640
She even sent me her favorite waxberries.

18:39.880 --> 18:41.400
Master Mu likes waxberries?

18:42.310 --> 18:43.920
But why did she tell me that she never eats

18:44.030 --> 18:45.200
sour things the last time she saw me?

18:50.310 --> 18:51.750
Of course she doesn't like sour things.

18:53.270 --> 18:55.030
After being Qingge's disciple for so long,

18:55.640 --> 18:56.720
you don't even know

18:56.740 --> 18:57.430
what she likes to eat.

19:15.510 --> 19:16.510
Strange.

19:17.110 --> 19:18.790
One said she likes sour things,

19:19.240 --> 19:20.400
and the other said she doesn't.

19:21.000 --> 19:21.750
Why is that?

19:22.860 --> 19:24.580
She wrote Collection of Entertainment,

19:25.000 --> 19:25.920
but now she doesn't seem like

19:25.920 --> 19:27.030
an interesting person at all.

19:28.240 --> 19:29.030
Why do I always feel that

19:29.030 --> 19:30.160
something's off

19:30.400 --> 19:31.400
with this Mu Qingge?

19:33.550 --> 19:34.960
Xue Ranran, what are you thinking about?

19:35.260 --> 19:36.110
Anyway, no matter

19:36.110 --> 19:36.880
what Mu Qingge is like,

19:37.130 --> 19:38.130
the person Master cares about

19:38.160 --> 19:38.830
is still her.

19:40.170 --> 19:40.760
You shouldn't have

19:40.790 --> 19:41.750
any more expectations.

19:50.270 --> 19:51.480
Why are you spacing out here alone?

19:54.440 --> 19:55.110
It's nothing.

19:55.590 --> 19:56.440
I'm just thinking about

19:56.550 --> 19:57.870
what to do after leaving here.

19:58.440 --> 19:59.180
Oh, Mr. Yu,

19:59.590 --> 20:00.720
what's the capital like?

20:00.960 --> 20:02.310
I heard it's very big and bustling.

20:03.200 --> 20:04.240
Do you think it would be a good idea

20:04.270 --> 20:05.720
for me to open a restaurant there?

20:06.070 --> 20:06.920
You want to go to the capital?

20:08.030 --> 20:08.830
As long as you want to go there,

20:09.440 --> 20:10.720
I can arrange everything for you.

20:11.480 --> 20:12.890
I'll take you to explore the entire capital,

20:13.110 --> 20:13.920
see plays,

20:14.590 --> 20:15.680
watch the mountains covered in maple leaves,

20:16.070 --> 20:17.440
and eat the best Eight-Treasure Duck.

20:17.750 --> 20:19.270
Mr. Yu, I...

20:19.290 --> 20:20.700
When did you get the idea to go to the capital?

20:22.110 --> 20:22.880
Master, have you forgotten?

20:23.280 --> 20:24.790
Haven't I always wanted to go to the capital?

20:25.240 --> 20:26.310
You said it yourself, Master,

20:26.720 --> 20:27.590
that once I settle down

20:27.960 --> 20:28.960
and find a husband,

20:29.270 --> 20:30.350
you would prepare a dowry for me.

20:30.830 --> 20:31.550
I think

20:32.070 --> 20:33.720
the capital is a great place to settle down.

20:34.880 --> 20:35.440
Alright.

20:35.920 --> 20:36.440
Ranran,

20:36.880 --> 20:38.310
I'll wait for you in the capital then.

20:47.820 --> 20:49.590
That's the person who drove us away earlier.

20:49.790 --> 20:50.310
Be careful.

20:51.110 --> 20:51.880
She has

20:51.880 --> 20:53.120
the same energy as that old man.

20:53.550 --> 20:54.550
I mean no harm.

20:54.880 --> 20:55.920
I am him,

20:57.280 --> 20:58.320
yet I am not him.

20:58.590 --> 20:59.400
What do you mean by that?

21:00.240 --> 21:01.200
Don't play tricks.

21:10.510 --> 21:11.510
Two souls in one body?

21:12.590 --> 21:13.550
You share the same body

21:13.880 --> 21:14.960
with that Mr. Liu?

21:15.440 --> 21:16.270
Actually,

21:16.510 --> 21:18.170
it's more like my soul

21:18.200 --> 21:19.510
resides in Mr. Liu's body.

21:20.000 --> 21:20.720
However,

21:20.810 --> 21:22.770
I can only appear at dusk and dawn,

21:22.790 --> 21:23.890
when day and night

21:23.920 --> 21:24.720
change.

21:25.110 --> 21:26.550
Earlier, I didn't have much time.

21:26.960 --> 21:28.550
Don't come in! Don't come in!

21:28.640 --> 21:29.240
Be careful!

21:29.880 --> 21:31.440
I couldn't explain it to you.

21:31.790 --> 21:32.550
so

21:33.310 --> 21:34.680
I thought it best to drive you away first.

21:35.270 --> 21:36.310
Who are you?

21:37.140 --> 21:40.210
[Meng Zhang, Green Dragon]

21:37.200 --> 21:38.070
My name is Meng Zhang.

21:38.790 --> 21:39.350
I was originally

21:39.370 --> 21:41.180
a Green Dragon on Divine Dragon Island.

21:42.200 --> 21:43.030
You're a dragon?

21:43.750 --> 21:44.510
Many years ago,

21:44.880 --> 21:46.720
I left the island on an errand.

21:47.000 --> 21:47.720
Unexpectedly,

21:48.110 --> 21:48.830
I met

21:49.030 --> 21:50.640
the love of my life,

21:51.240 --> 21:51.790
Liu.

21:52.410 --> 21:53.370
Are you talking about

21:53.400 --> 21:54.400
that Mr. Liu?

21:55.030 --> 21:56.370
I secretly stayed in the mortal world

21:56.880 --> 21:58.310
and spent many happy years with him.

21:58.720 --> 21:59.590
However,

21:59.960 --> 22:01.750
19 years ago, during the Battle of Fanyao,

22:02.280 --> 22:03.210
I lost a dragon egg

22:03.240 --> 22:04.790
that I had been guarding for years.

22:05.310 --> 22:06.770
While searching for the egg,

22:07.350 --> 22:09.320
I was mortally wounded by a beast that escaped

22:09.350 --> 22:10.440
from the netherworld and died.

22:11.110 --> 22:12.750
Liu was devastated

22:13.510 --> 22:14.850
and unwilling to let me go.

22:14.880 --> 22:17.510
Unexpectedly, he was deceived by the Spirit Spring.

22:17.720 --> 22:18.440
The Spirit Spring?

22:25.790 --> 22:27.000
It's just to make him lose consciousness for a moment.

22:27.550 --> 22:28.240
The Spirit Spring

22:28.310 --> 22:29.310
must not be known to more people.

22:29.920 --> 22:30.790
The situation here

22:30.920 --> 22:31.960
is indeed related to the Spirit Spring.

22:33.720 --> 22:34.550
What did you mean

22:34.750 --> 22:36.380
when you said that Mr. Liu was deceived

22:36.750 --> 22:37.590
by the Spirit Spring?

22:41.790 --> 22:42.920
The Seven Evil Transformation Spell?

22:43.610 --> 22:45.170
The Spirit Spring entered Liu's dreams and bewitched him,

22:45.190 --> 22:46.350
causing him to practice this spell,

22:46.680 --> 22:48.110
merging my dragon soul

22:48.130 --> 22:49.000
with his body.

22:49.310 --> 22:50.550
Because the Spirit Spring told him

22:50.830 --> 22:52.590
that if he followed its instructions,

22:52.790 --> 22:54.440
it could bring me back to life.

22:55.030 --> 22:56.410
My lingering soul remained.

22:56.830 --> 22:57.880
But from then,

22:58.570 --> 22:59.410
Liu and I

22:59.440 --> 23:00.550
have been sharing one body.

23:01.680 --> 23:02.880
Although we are together,

23:03.880 --> 23:05.350
we can never truly meet.

23:07.110 --> 23:09.920
However, Liu became increasingly obsessed after that.

23:10.120 --> 23:11.560
He obtained the Green Dragon Divine Power

23:11.590 --> 23:12.550
from my body

23:12.960 --> 23:14.680
and used it to subdue a Nine-Headed Kui'ao.

23:15.240 --> 23:16.200
Was it your Liu

23:16.270 --> 23:17.480
who controlled the Nine-Headed Kui'ao

23:17.550 --> 23:18.830
and stole the Spirit Spring from Wangxiang Pass?

23:19.310 --> 23:19.720
Yes,

23:20.440 --> 23:21.400
it was he

23:21.590 --> 23:22.830
who stole the soul-sealing stele that was sealing

23:22.830 --> 23:23.790
the Spirit Spring,

23:24.830 --> 23:26.350
found nine evil swords,

23:27.240 --> 23:28.750
and created the Soul Devouring Formation.

23:29.480 --> 23:30.550
For over a decade,

23:31.070 --> 23:32.350
Liu has been constantly luring

23:32.370 --> 23:33.100
living people here,

23:34.160 --> 23:35.440
allowing the Nine-Headed Kui'ao

23:35.590 --> 23:37.440
to devour souls and accumulate resentment.

23:38.240 --> 23:39.750
Therefore, the power of the Nine-Headed Kui'ao

23:40.030 --> 23:41.440
has grown stronger and stronger,

23:41.790 --> 23:44.720
and it has gradually merged with the mountain.

23:45.510 --> 23:46.680
The Spirit Spring is truly despicable.

23:46.750 --> 23:47.400
It actually took advantage

23:47.720 --> 23:49.160
of Mr. Liu's love

23:49.270 --> 23:50.000
and lured him into doing evil things.

23:52.960 --> 23:54.000
I never expected

23:54.270 --> 23:55.480
that the Seven Evil Transformation Spell

23:55.750 --> 23:56.480
could not only fuse a person

23:56.480 --> 23:57.720
with a beast's body

23:58.160 --> 23:59.550
but also integrate a dragon's soul into one's body.

24:00.010 --> 24:00.650
It seems that the reason

24:00.680 --> 24:02.000
that the Spirit Spring chose your Liu from the very beginning

24:02.320 --> 24:02.930
was to

24:02.960 --> 24:03.750
use your Green Dragon Divine Power.

24:04.670 --> 24:05.340
So,

24:06.030 --> 24:07.550
the Nine-Headed Kui'ao devouring souls

24:07.750 --> 24:08.680
and accumulating resentment

24:09.110 --> 24:10.160
is actually to

24:10.480 --> 24:11.680
nourish the Spirit Spring inside it,

24:12.160 --> 24:13.400
allowing it to break through the seal.

24:13.650 --> 24:15.300
Now, whether it's to break the formation to escape

24:15.510 --> 24:16.480
or to find the Spirit Spring,

24:16.740 --> 24:17.440
we must locate

24:17.460 --> 24:18.730
the body of the Nine-Headed Kui'ao.

24:19.110 --> 24:20.110
I know where it is.

24:21.930 --> 24:23.000
I can tell you

24:23.030 --> 24:24.180
where the body of the Kui'ao is.

24:24.550 --> 24:25.510
If the formation is broken,

24:25.550 --> 24:27.440
Liu will no longer be able to harm anyone.

24:27.920 --> 24:28.720
However,

24:30.110 --> 24:30.880
I want to ask you

24:30.880 --> 24:32.030
to agree to two conditions.

24:33.720 --> 24:34.270
First,

24:35.110 --> 24:36.240
don't harm Liu.

24:36.790 --> 24:38.640
All his crimes and heavenly punishments

24:39.110 --> 24:40.510
will be shouldered by me alone.

24:41.000 --> 24:41.790
Second,

24:42.440 --> 24:43.550
I want to ask you

24:43.790 --> 24:44.720
to help me retrieve

24:44.750 --> 24:45.790
the dragon egg I lost.

24:46.790 --> 24:47.550
Would you...

24:48.510 --> 24:49.310
agree?

24:50.680 --> 24:51.070
Alright.

24:51.480 --> 24:52.110
I promise you.

24:52.960 --> 24:53.480
Xue Ranran.

24:53.880 --> 24:54.440
Master,

24:54.720 --> 24:55.310
I trust her.

24:56.000 --> 24:56.750
Besides,

24:57.310 --> 24:58.680
if we find the formation's core ourselves,

24:58.920 --> 24:59.880
it will take a lot of time.

25:02.030 --> 25:03.160
Since you've agreed,

25:03.640 --> 25:05.350
please swear a soul oath

25:05.680 --> 25:07.270
that you will help me find the dragon egg

25:07.400 --> 25:08.720
and safely send it to the Dragon Island.

25:09.350 --> 25:10.030
Otherwise,

25:10.490 --> 25:11.450
you will suffer the punishment

25:11.480 --> 25:12.720
of your spiritual power dissipating completely.

25:19.440 --> 25:19.960
Master...

25:21.480 --> 25:22.260
The soul oath has been made.

25:22.930 --> 25:23.520
Speak now.

25:28.070 --> 25:28.590
Oh no.

25:29.000 --> 25:30.030
Dawn is approaching.

25:32.960 --> 25:33.480
Zhang,

25:34.160 --> 25:34.720
go back.

25:35.270 --> 25:35.880
Go back!

25:43.070 --> 25:44.400
According to the map,

25:44.440 --> 25:45.520
you can avoid the formation

25:45.550 --> 25:47.200
and find the body of the Nine-Headed Kui'ao.

25:50.720 --> 25:52.030
Destroy the nine evil swords,

25:52.150 --> 25:53.330
and the formation will be broken.

26:07.680 --> 26:08.030
Let's go.

26:14.680 --> 26:15.440
Where are we?

26:20.030 --> 26:20.750
There's a sword light.

26:21.480 --> 26:22.550
The formation's core is indeed here.

26:27.210 --> 26:28.080
It seems

26:28.110 --> 26:29.200
the Kui'ao's shell is down here.

26:30.070 --> 26:31.000
It's so large.

26:32.640 --> 26:33.030
This formation

26:33.030 --> 26:34.310
has allowed it to absorb a lot of resentment,

26:35.070 --> 26:36.110
so it has grown enormous.

26:37.110 --> 26:38.400
We must go down there

26:38.640 --> 26:39.400
and destroy this formation

26:39.550 --> 26:40.440
to restore everything to normal.

26:41.160 --> 26:42.070
You all stay up here and wait for me.

26:48.590 --> 26:49.440
You're asking for death!

26:53.510 --> 26:54.270
Master, be careful!

26:55.160 --> 26:56.030
I'll hold him off.

26:56.350 --> 26:57.510
You go down and destroy the swords to break the formation.

26:57.640 --> 26:58.310
Master!

26:58.480 --> 26:59.200
Go!

27:20.580 --> 27:21.400
We are...

27:21.680 --> 27:22.960
on the back of the Nine-Headed Kui'ao?

27:33.470 --> 27:34.880
Everyone, help me block these resentments

27:35.110 --> 27:35.830
and break a path open.

27:36.030 --> 27:36.750
I'll charge in!

27:56.030 --> 27:57.110
Don't waste your energy.

27:57.480 --> 27:59.290
Those nine swords are exceptionally fierce.

27:59.510 --> 28:00.960
How could your little disciples

28:00.960 --> 28:01.590
deal with them?

28:01.960 --> 28:02.680
Go to hell!

28:20.060 --> 28:21.440
He has the Green Dragon Divine Power within him,

28:21.720 --> 28:22.590
making him no ordinary person.

28:23.560 --> 28:24.400
He's not easy to deal with.

28:37.110 --> 28:37.830
Soul-hosting Stone?

28:55.550 --> 28:56.070
Ranran!

29:45.530 --> 29:46.420
Master!

29:59.920 --> 30:01.030
Qingge's Qingming Sword?

30:02.240 --> 30:03.200
Qingming Sword can only be used by its master.

30:03.930 --> 30:05.210
Only Qingge can resonate with the spiritual power

30:05.240 --> 30:06.160
of Qingming Sword.

30:09.640 --> 30:10.310
It's really you,

30:11.270 --> 30:11.970
Qingge.

30:19.400 --> 30:20.030
One Qi!

30:22.880 --> 30:23.640
Break the galaxy!

30:39.400 --> 30:39.970
Master.

30:40.350 --> 30:41.070
I'm fine.

30:46.830 --> 30:47.680
So, Qingming Sword

30:47.680 --> 30:48.640
was sealed here by you

30:48.640 --> 30:49.400
to suppress the Spirit Spring.

30:51.960 --> 30:52.680
Ranran.

30:54.650 --> 30:55.210
Ranran.

31:06.030 --> 31:07.400
Without the nourishment of resentment,

31:07.680 --> 31:09.160
the spiritual power of the Nine-Headed Kui'ao will dissipate,

31:09.480 --> 31:10.510
and it will no longer be able to imprison

31:10.510 --> 31:11.440
those souls it devoured.

31:11.880 --> 31:13.200
They will return to their bodies on their own.

31:13.810 --> 31:14.850
The bodies of those who were devoured

31:14.880 --> 31:16.440
by the Nine-Headed Kui'ao not long ago are still intact

31:16.720 --> 31:17.790
and will soon awaken.

31:21.200 --> 31:22.030
This formation has been destroyed.

31:22.250 --> 31:23.770
The Nine-Headed Kui'ao will turn to stone

31:23.800 --> 31:25.230
and merge with the earth.

31:39.720 --> 31:40.270
Sure enough,

31:40.920 --> 31:41.830
it's that drop of the Spirit Spring.

31:43.720 --> 31:44.550
Su Yishui!

31:45.790 --> 31:47.270
As long as you're alive,

31:47.540 --> 31:48.930
you'll never escape the fate

31:48.960 --> 31:50.200
of being the Demon's child!

31:51.590 --> 31:52.510
Constantly refined

31:52.920 --> 31:54.130
until it turns into bone and blood.

31:55.120 --> 31:56.170
So, this drop of the Spirit Spring

31:56.200 --> 31:57.000
can never be completely removed.

31:59.440 --> 32:00.030
Master,

32:00.350 --> 32:01.110
are you alright?

32:07.030 --> 32:07.830
No matter what,

32:08.590 --> 32:09.880
I should seal the Spirit Spring first.

32:11.720 --> 32:12.400
Xi'er, Gao Cang,

32:12.750 --> 32:14.100
go and keep an eye on that Mr. Liu

32:14.350 --> 32:15.330
and take the villagers who've awakened

32:15.440 --> 32:16.030
out of here.

32:16.830 --> 32:17.830
-Yes, Master.
-Yes, Master.

32:24.240 --> 32:25.270
Your soldiers

32:25.550 --> 32:26.590
should be waking up soon.

32:29.680 --> 32:30.200
Ranran,

32:31.200 --> 32:32.110
I'll wait for you outside.

32:39.030 --> 32:39.680
Master.

32:44.350 --> 32:46.000
Is this the spell seal?

32:47.790 --> 32:48.880
This is indeed her spell seal,

32:50.510 --> 32:51.880
the one she set up using her Golden Core

32:52.240 --> 32:53.200
as the key back then.

32:54.480 --> 32:55.920
You're overdrawing your spiritual power with your lifespan?

32:58.480 --> 32:59.080
Why...

33:00.310 --> 33:01.200
is your Golden Core gone too?

33:06.000 --> 33:07.480
The only one who would empty their own Golden Core

33:07.680 --> 33:08.720
regardless of the consequences

33:09.030 --> 33:10.030
is Mu Qingge.

33:11.590 --> 33:12.160
Master,

33:12.590 --> 33:13.310
let's get to the task at hand.

33:18.790 --> 33:20.350
The seal has indeed loosened.

33:20.960 --> 33:22.200
That's why the demonic nature of the Spirit Spring

33:22.350 --> 33:23.400
has spread further and further

33:23.790 --> 33:24.790
and affected Wangxiang Pass.

33:25.510 --> 33:26.590
If we had come any later,

33:26.880 --> 33:28.330
the resentment accumulated by the Nine-Headed Kui'ao

33:28.500 --> 33:29.370
might have helped the Spirit Spring

33:29.390 --> 33:30.040
break through the seal

33:30.070 --> 33:30.510
and escape.

33:32.920 --> 33:33.680
There seem to be

33:33.920 --> 33:35.030
some words carved here.

33:48.850 --> 33:49.550
Shui,

33:50.310 --> 33:51.640
it must be you.

33:52.960 --> 33:53.920
Remember what you promised me.

33:54.480 --> 33:56.480
You must return the Spirit Spring to the netherworld.

33:57.240 --> 33:58.200
Don't have any other thoughts.

33:59.400 --> 34:00.110
Remember that.

34:03.310 --> 34:03.830
Oh, right.

34:04.640 --> 34:06.240
I've also hidden

34:06.310 --> 34:07.290
a jar of freshly brewed Mistaken Divine

34:07.320 --> 34:08.639
behind the waterfall in Mount Wester.

34:07.800 --> 34:13.139
♫I've shed thousands of tears, but my feelings haven't run dry♫

34:10.190 --> 34:11.000
I think

34:11.760 --> 34:13.320
I may no longer be able to drink it myself.

34:14.070 --> 34:15.670
Please enjoy it on my behalf.

34:14.670 --> 34:20.030
♫Hatred adds grayness to my hair♫

34:16.550 --> 34:17.840
Don't let the years of aging

34:18.110 --> 34:19.400
go to waste.

34:20.920 --> 34:22.320
July of the Year of Jiashen.

34:21.210 --> 34:24.370
♫Which side does destiny choose?♫

34:23.280 --> 34:24.230
Mu Qingge.

34:24.639 --> 34:27.760
♫Demon or immortal?♫

34:28.170 --> 34:33.820
♫With you by my side, I'm fearless in the face of life's hardships♫

34:35.030 --> 34:38.290
♫If love wants me to die♫

34:38.840 --> 34:41.900
♫I won't give up because of you♫

34:41.920 --> 34:43.830
♫Thousands of steps to cross the sky-high chasm♫

34:43.860 --> 34:47.880
♫Reincarnation and fate can't be denied♫

34:47.900 --> 34:51.980
♫Why does the world have everything but love?♫

34:52.239 --> 34:55.210
♫Falling forever is like becoming immortal♫

34:55.659 --> 35:01.780
♫I insist to be with you day after day♫

35:08.290 --> 35:09.760
July of the Year of Jiashen?

35:10.520 --> 35:12.000
That was just before Master Mu was besieged

35:12.030 --> 35:13.000
by the four Heavenly Sects.

35:13.840 --> 35:14.840
In that case,

35:15.550 --> 35:16.590
these words

35:15.670 --> 35:25.770
♫The moment between us is worth 10,000 years♫

35:17.090 --> 35:18.230
must be Master Mu's

35:18.280 --> 35:19.680
last wish from her previous life.

35:22.000 --> 35:23.880
This is what Mu Qingge left for Master.

35:24.440 --> 35:25.230
Master must not

35:25.230 --> 35:26.660
have wanted anyone else to pry into it.

35:27.760 --> 35:28.800
Why did I look at it?

35:28.920 --> 35:29.760
And I've said too much.

35:31.400 --> 35:31.920
Forget it.

35:32.530 --> 35:33.250
Anyway, I don't really want

35:33.280 --> 35:34.320
to know more about them.

35:40.440 --> 35:41.550
How carefree

35:41.550 --> 35:42.440
must a person be,

35:43.110 --> 35:44.000
knowing they're going to die,

35:44.670 --> 35:45.630
yet the only thing they worry about

35:45.920 --> 35:46.960
is just a jar of wine?

35:48.590 --> 35:49.840
Master, do you think

35:50.150 --> 35:51.400
Grandmaster's final words

35:51.400 --> 35:52.480
were too casual?

35:52.880 --> 35:53.800
Worried about a jar of wine,

35:53.800 --> 35:54.800
but not about you?

35:55.280 --> 35:56.230
So you're upset?

35:57.190 --> 35:58.440
You truly don't care

35:58.440 --> 35:59.790
about your life at all.

36:02.360 --> 36:03.760
Master, if you have any resentment,

36:04.230 --> 36:05.000
tell Master Mu about it

36:05.000 --> 36:05.720
in the future.

36:06.590 --> 36:07.920
The matter of the Spirit Spring hasn't been resolved yet.

36:22.480 --> 36:23.150
The Spirit Spring?

36:24.710 --> 36:25.400
What's on this

36:26.130 --> 36:27.330
is Grandmaster's Golden Core?

36:36.360 --> 36:37.150
Demon's child.

36:37.400 --> 36:38.510
It's the Demon's child.

36:39.900 --> 36:42.040
I've been waiting for you for a long time.

36:42.070 --> 36:43.620
Master, are you alright?

36:59.630 --> 37:00.590
Demon's child,

37:01.050 --> 37:03.280
are you really willing to seal me?

37:04.630 --> 37:06.880
The drop of the Spirit Spring in your heart is still there.

37:07.410 --> 37:08.680
If you give me your body,

37:08.710 --> 37:09.920
we can merge.

37:11.030 --> 37:13.070
I possess supreme magical power

37:13.480 --> 37:15.190
and can give you everything you desire,

37:15.670 --> 37:16.510
including

37:16.960 --> 37:19.070
that little disciple of yours outside.

37:20.880 --> 37:21.480
Yes,

37:22.110 --> 37:23.150
that's right.

37:23.880 --> 37:26.030
Give me your body.

37:27.400 --> 37:28.000
Master!

37:49.190 --> 37:50.480
The Spirit Spring has been successfully sealed.

37:53.400 --> 37:54.760
Master, what's wrong with you?

37:55.110 --> 37:56.440
Why do you look so pale?

37:57.510 --> 37:58.190
I'm fine.

37:58.900 --> 37:59.630
This Heavenly Bottle

37:59.630 --> 38:00.690
sealed the Spirit Spring very quickly.

38:01.600 --> 38:02.330
It shouldn't have triggered the reaction

38:02.360 --> 38:03.590
of the Yin Eye Stone from the Heavenly Sect.

38:03.960 --> 38:04.760
Otherwise, we'd be in trouble.

38:05.840 --> 38:06.440
However,

38:07.480 --> 38:09.030
it can only temporarily seal the Spirit Spring.

38:09.970 --> 38:11.070
We must send the Spirit Spring

38:11.070 --> 38:11.760
back to the netherworld as soon as possible.

38:22.030 --> 38:23.070
The Spirit Spring is of utmost importance.

38:23.360 --> 38:24.780
Do not let anyone else know about the Heavenly Bottle.

38:25.110 --> 38:26.230
Yes, Master.

38:27.440 --> 38:28.320
But Master,

38:28.670 --> 38:30.360
the Spirit Spring is so dangerous,

38:30.710 --> 38:32.360
and the Heavenly Bottle is so chillingly cold.

38:33.000 --> 38:34.550
You're carrying it with you.

38:34.800 --> 38:35.440
what if...

38:37.400 --> 38:38.630
Using this bottle to seal the Spirit Spring

38:38.760 --> 38:39.630
is not a perfect solution.

38:40.280 --> 38:41.320
I can only carry it with me

38:41.550 --> 38:42.840
and constantly suppress it with my spiritual power

38:43.000 --> 38:44.190
to avoid any issues.

38:46.000 --> 38:46.760
As long as we send the Spirit Spring

38:46.760 --> 38:47.920
back to the netherworld as soon as possible,

38:52.400 --> 38:53.710
I won't be in any danger.

38:55.900 --> 38:56.710
Let's go out first.

39:07.440 --> 39:07.880
Master.

39:07.920 --> 39:08.400
Master.

39:10.640 --> 39:11.890
The villagers and soldiers

39:11.920 --> 39:12.440
who were rescued

39:12.460 --> 39:13.390
have been settled

39:13.480 --> 39:14.490
and are slowly recovering.

39:23.760 --> 39:24.360
Ranran,

39:24.760 --> 39:25.630
it's all thanks to you this time.

39:26.670 --> 39:27.760
I owe you another favor for this.

39:29.280 --> 39:29.950
Mr. Yu,

39:30.070 --> 39:30.980
please don't be so formal.

39:34.070 --> 39:34.800
I once saw

39:35.290 --> 39:36.810
this sword in a painting

39:36.840 --> 39:37.400
at the Consonance Palace.

39:37.640 --> 39:38.520
It should be Mu Qingge's

39:38.550 --> 39:39.360
Qingming Sword, right?

39:39.920 --> 39:41.070
It's indeed Qingge's sword.

39:41.630 --> 39:42.880
The situation was critical earlier.

39:43.360 --> 39:44.890
Perhaps Master Mu's sword

39:45.000 --> 39:46.280
sensed the techniques of the Wester Sect

39:46.660 --> 39:47.950
and flew out to help us.

39:48.840 --> 39:50.040
Now that the crisis is over,

39:50.320 --> 39:51.160
Mr. Yu,

39:51.460 --> 39:52.730
please return this sword

39:53.230 --> 39:54.630
to Master Mu on my behalf.

39:55.490 --> 39:56.080
Since it was you

39:56.110 --> 39:57.360
who summoned Qingming Sword,

39:57.840 --> 39:59.110
it means that you have a connection with it.

39:59.920 --> 40:01.150
How about you

40:01.800 --> 40:02.710
keep the sword with you?

40:04.190 --> 40:04.840
Keep it.

40:05.550 --> 40:06.920
It originally belonged to the Wester Sect anyway.

40:08.230 --> 40:09.080
In that case,

40:09.360 --> 40:10.190
I will keep it.

40:18.590 --> 40:19.190
Master,

40:19.800 --> 40:21.550
what about Mr. Liu?

40:29.710 --> 40:30.320
No!

40:30.750 --> 40:31.280
No!

40:31.800 --> 40:32.240
Don't!

40:32.470 --> 40:33.550
No, no! Don't!

40:35.360 --> 40:35.960
My spiritual power!

40:36.530 --> 40:37.390
Where's my spiritual power?

40:37.960 --> 40:38.880
My... my...

40:43.090 --> 40:43.800
It was close.

40:43.880 --> 40:44.630
It was so close!

40:45.190 --> 40:45.970
My spiritual power...

40:50.910 --> 40:51.590
It was so close.

40:51.590 --> 40:53.960
-The Seven Evil Transformation Spell has been broken.
-It was so close.

40:55.400 --> 40:55.900
Zhang!

40:56.510 --> 40:57.000
Zhang!

40:58.320 --> 41:00.000
I still can't save you,

41:00.030 --> 41:00.550
Zhang.

41:02.670 --> 41:03.030
Zhang,

41:03.400 --> 41:04.140
you can't come out!

41:04.360 --> 41:05.260
You can't leave me!

41:06.030 --> 41:07.550
You can't leave me, Zhang!

41:09.190 --> 41:09.960
You can't leave me!

41:10.130 --> 41:10.910
You can't leave me!

41:14.030 --> 41:14.800
You can't leave me...

41:16.070 --> 41:16.800
Liu.

41:22.190 --> 41:22.710
Zhang?

41:23.140 --> 41:23.670
Zhang!

41:28.280 --> 41:28.960
Zhang!

41:35.920 --> 41:36.250
I...

41:36.280 --> 41:38.230
I can finally see you again.

41:44.320 --> 41:45.840
You're still so beautiful.

41:51.030 --> 41:51.880
Zhang,

41:52.110 --> 41:53.590
why are you so foolish?

41:54.040 --> 41:55.460
I could have saved you.

41:55.480 --> 41:56.520
I could have.

41:56.550 --> 41:58.190
I could have saved you.

41:59.410 --> 42:00.710
I could have saved you.

42:00.960 --> 42:03.070
Our sins are too grave.

42:04.760 --> 42:05.630
Liu,

42:07.800 --> 42:08.880
let it go.

42:10.090 --> 42:11.320
Don't harm any more

42:11.400 --> 42:13.770
innocent people for me.

42:29.580 --> 42:30.580
Thank you all

42:32.280 --> 42:33.800
for helping me put an end to all of this.

42:38.510 --> 42:39.030
Zhang!

42:43.790 --> 42:44.470
Farewell,

42:46.880 --> 42:47.590
Liu.

42:49.840 --> 42:50.400
No!

42:50.850 --> 42:51.430
Zhang!

42:55.110 --> 42:55.550
Zhang.

42:56.710 --> 42:57.280
Zhang!

42:57.880 --> 42:59.360
Zhang!

42:59.630 --> 43:01.360
Zhang!

43:03.840 --> 43:05.190
Zhang!

43:05.540 --> 43:06.830
Zhang!

43:08.000 --> 43:08.710
Zhang!

43:09.670 --> 43:10.670
Zhang!

43:10.880 --> 43:12.230
Zhang!

43:12.630 --> 43:14.470
Don't leave me!

43:15.870 --> 43:17.070
Don't leave me alone!

43:17.090 --> 43:18.510
I'd rather die!

43:18.960 --> 43:20.190
It was all my fault.

43:20.350 --> 43:22.350
Let the Heavenly Way punish me!

43:22.370 --> 43:23.640
Zhang!
